Name: libheif public API headers
URL: https://github.com/strukturag/libheif
Version: 1.19.8
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later
License File: COPYING
Security Critical: yes

Only API declarations are vendored. No libheif implementation or codec plugin
is built here. crFiles dynamically loads the system libheif.so.1 on Linux and
app-local heif.dll on Windows. Windows packaging accepts a prepared runtime
with a built-in HEVC backend and validates its exports and DLL dependencies.
Deployments must keep runtime libraries and decoder plugins updated.
macOS uses ImageIO and does not load libheif.

Local modifications: heif.h's version include points to the local version
header. heif_version.h contains the pinned release's version constants.
